   {
    "text": "**Title: \"Layton's Light\"**\n\nIn a town where the sun never sets,  \nLayton walks with a quiet, steady beat.  \nA quiet, steady beat, a gentle refrain,  \nA rhythm that guides the hearts of the land.\n\nHe’s the one who finds the way through the maze,  \nA steady guide in the darkest of days.  \nWith a heart full of hope, he never gives up,  \nA promise he makes, a promise he keeps.\n\nThe people he meets, they all know his name,  \nA legend in the town where he’s been.  \nLayton’s light shines through every door,  \nA beacon of hope in a world that’s so far.\n\nSo here’s to Layton, the heart of the town,  \nWith a spirit that’s true, and a soul that’s unbound.  \nA man who walks with a purpose, a dream,  \nA story that’s written in every town.\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The letter \"a\" is used only once in the line: *\"A steady guide in the darkest of days.\"*",
